  "caveats": {
    "vllm-accept-def": {
      "mark": "ᵃ",
      "text_md": "vLLM's definition, `1 + accepted/drafts`. sglang's is `completion_tokens / verify steps`. Compare accept_len within an engine or between the two vLLM hosts, not vLLM against sglang."
    },
    "e2e-rates": {
      "mark": "ᵇ",
      "text_md": "End-to-end rates: client wall time including TTFT on vLLM, the server's `e2e_latency` on sglang. Compare each column across rows and never multiply accept_len × steps/s into a decode rate."
    },
    "sglang-accept-flushed": {
      "mark": "ᶜ",
      "text_md": "One `bench_spec_accept.py` run per mode from a flushed cache. The thinking-off figure pairs with the row's speed columns; the thinking-on figure is the one that compares with the 2026-09-27 sglang rows, which measured thinking on only."
    },
    "27b-max-running-2": {
      "mark": "ᵈ",
      "text_md": "`--max-running-requests=2` on the 27B profile, so two of the four streams queue; this is the profile's aggregate, not a 4-way-concurrent one."
    },
    "rg-on-node": {
      "mark": "ʰ",
      "text_md": "**On-node** `bench_decode_prefill.py` run 1 / run 2 (the same harness as every DGX cell, run on the RG node against `127.0.0.1:8000`), because the tunnel adds ~40 ms to TTFT."
    },
    "ple-first-batch-warmup": {
      "mark": "ⁱ",
      "text_md": "The Flash-Next PLE lane's first 4-stream run reads low at the same per-stream rate (V1-02 244.0 / 307.3, V1-09b 274.3 / 308.6): a first-batch warmup, so use run 2."
    },
    "dgx-0930-one-boot": {
      "mark": "ᵏ",
      "text_md": "The 2026-09-30 DGX rows are one boot each. The vLLM rows' 120-frame cell is the flushed-rep range (prefix caching is off)."
    },
    "prefill-27b-cold-alt": {
      "mark": "ᵍ",
      "text_md": "`bench_decode_prefill.py` run 1 / run 2, the harness behind every other prefill cell. `bench_prefill_cold.py` (3 reps, each with a unique nonce prefix; sglang doesn't report cached tokens) gave 2,336–2,475."
    },
    "vl-27b-no-spec": {
      "mark": "²",
      "text_md": "**The 27B vision profile runs without speculative decoding.** sglang's image path has no spec decode for the ratio-3 arch, and llama.cpp's MTP draft crashes once an image enters (llama.cpp #25144, unmerged as of 2026-08-15). `serve/compose.qwen38-vl.yaml`'s header has the decision and revisit triggers."
    }
  },
